# Api adapter

Override the generated gRPC service method, construct the Application command or query, and send it with `context.CancellationToken`. Keep persistence and domain decisions in the owning layers.

Declare forwarding gRPC overrides and asynchronous event handlers with `async`. Await the mediator and propagate the cancellation token. For a gRPC method that only sends a command or query, use an expression body. Put `=>` at the end of the signature and the awaited call on the next line.

```csharp
public override async Task<CloseProjectResponse> CloseProject(CloseProjectRequest request, ServerCallContext context) =>
    await mediator.Send(new CloseProject(request), context.CancellationToken);
```
